  x-mod-sumdb-tlog.json in the truestamp_merkle repository) holds the same
  record texts and hashes.
  No golang.org/x/mod source code is copied or vendored here: the program
  imports golang.org/x/mod/sumdb/tlog as a module dependency. The upstream
  module also ships a PATENTS grant for the Go project; it is not reproduced
  here because none of the upstream implementation is.

Files here with no upstream material (Apache-2.0 only): reference.go, ours.go,
go.mod, go.sum, README.md. ours.go takes tlog's error texts from tlog at run
time instead of quoting them.
